1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,160
So, as we begin the school year

2
00:00:01,160 --> 00:00:02,720
as you know, for many parents

3
00:00:02,720 --> 00:00:04,920
it's also a time where there are a lot of expenses for school

4
00:00:04,920 --> 00:00:07,520
and we want our kids to have the best start in life.

5
00:00:07,520 --> 00:00:11,000
You have things like schoolbooks, textbooks, uniforms

6
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:15,380
and other expenses that parents have to fork out.

7
00:00:15,380 --> 00:00:16,300
And during these times

8
00:00:16,300 --> 00:00:19,160
especially when you have cost of living concerns

9
00:00:19,160 --> 00:00:20,480
challenging times

10
00:00:20,480 --> 00:00:22,160
we want to help parents from low-income families

11
00:00:22,160 --> 00:00:22,900
to support their kids.

12
00:00:22,900 --> 00:00:28,200
MENDAKI is introducing the Ready for School e-voucher initiative

13
00:00:28,200 --> 00:00:29,460
which we hope to help kids

14
00:00:29,460 --> 00:00:32,140
from Primary One all the way up to university.

15
00:00:32,140 --> 00:00:34,380
This year, MENDAKI is giving out $250 e-vouchers

16
00:00:34,380 --> 00:00:37,280
that parents can use for their children

17
00:00:37,280 --> 00:00:38,640
whether it's schoolbooks

18
00:00:38,640 --> 00:00:42,500
whether it is stationery or even shoes.

19
00:00:42,500 --> 00:00:43,480
I think it's important because

20
00:00:43,480 --> 00:00:45,780
especially for parents who have more than one child

21
00:00:45,780 --> 00:00:48,480
as you know, sometimes you have two or three kids.

22
00:00:48,480 --> 00:00:49,300
I think it's always challenging

23
00:00:49,300 --> 00:00:51,800
to try to fork out that much expense at one go.

24
00:00:51,800 --> 00:00:53,740
We are pegging it at about $1,000

25
00:00:53,740 --> 00:00:55,340
per capita income and below.

26
00:00:55,340 --> 00:00:58,040
So we expect more than 22,000 students

27
00:00:58,040 --> 00:00:59,560
who could benefit from this.

28
00:00:59,560 --> 00:01:01,580
And this is in addition to about 13,000 others

29
00:01:01,580 --> 00:01:03,400
that typically benefit from our TTFS

30
00:01:03,400 --> 00:01:04,880
and other MENDAKI schemes as well.

31
00:01:04,880 --> 00:01:05,800
So it's an application basis

32
00:01:05,800 --> 00:01:08,140
and we start to take applications from 1st December.

33
00:01:08,220 --> 00:01:10,600
So we hope that this will do its part

34
00:01:10,600 --> 00:01:14,200
to help parents and children have a good start for the year

35
00:01:14,200 --> 00:01:16,380
and not to worry about some of these expenses

36
00:01:16,380 --> 00:01:19,000
that would have otherwise held them back.
